WEBVTT

00:00:05.890 --> 00:00:08.870
OK, Philip. This is your third cup of coffee.

00:00:09.760 --> 00:00:11.180
We should get to work,

00:00:14.500 --> 00:00:15.820
I guess we must.

00:00:16.420 --> 00:00:17.140
We must.

00:00:19.200 --> 00:00:29.650
OK. The beginning of my famous Thanksgiving apple pie.

00:00:36.330 --> 00:00:38.420
Come on, Philip!

00:00:38.420 --> 00:00:41.440
Get busy with your famous apple pie.

00:00:41.440 --> 00:00:42.700
There's much more to be done.

00:00:43.220 --> 00:00:45.480
What goes into my apple pie besides apples?

00:01:01.960 --> 00:01:04.560
Butter, nice and cold and hard.

00:01:08.040 --> 00:01:09.620
Last but not least,

00:01:09.760 --> 00:01:13.660
the reason my apple pie is famous--cinnamon.

00:01:14.320 --> 00:01:15.080
Cinnamon ...

00:01:18.420 --> 00:01:19.800
Ellen, where's the cinnamon?

00:01:39.800 --> 00:01:40.600
Yes, Philip.

00:01:41.060 --> 00:01:43.540
Is it possible that we forgot to buy cinnamon?

00:01:45.620 --> 00:01:50.560
Yes, it is possible that we forgot to buy cinnamon.

00:01:50.980 --> 00:01:54.440
Well, how can I make my famous apple pie without cinnamon?

00:01:54.980 --> 00:01:55.980
Good morning.

00:01:56.580 --> 00:01:58.440
Oh, hi, Robbie. Good morning.

00:02:00.700 --> 00:02:02.060
Can you do me a favor?

00:02:02.490 --> 00:02:03.290
Sure, Dad. What?

00:02:03.980 --> 00:02:06.440
Remember my apple pie on Thanksgiving?

00:02:07.300 --> 00:02:09.760
What do you love about it?

00:02:11.640 --> 00:02:12.460
The apples?

00:02:16.100 --> 00:02:19.600
Right. We don't have any cinnamon.

00:02:20.480 --> 00:02:23.280
I'll go down to Henry's grocery. He's always open.

00:02:23.280 --> 00:02:24.340
I'll get some for you.

00:02:24.540 --> 00:02:25.520
That's my boy!

00:02:27.200 --> 00:02:28.930
Oh, put your heavy jacket on, Robbie.

00:02:28.930 --> 00:02:29.600
It's cold outside.

00:02:34.120 --> 00:02:35.620
Alexandra might call.

00:02:35.860 --> 00:02:37.660
Tell her I'll call her right back.

00:02:37.880 --> 00:02:38.340
OK.

00:02:39.580 --> 00:02:40.420
Thanks, Son.

00:03:05.740 --> 00:03:06.840
Robbie just went to the store.

00:03:07.500 --> 00:03:08.280
He'll be back soon.

00:03:08.300 --> 00:03:09.400
He said he'll call you.

00:03:10.020 --> 00:03:14.920
... Oh, oh, I see.... Oh ... certainly.

00:03:18.460 --> 00:03:23.340
... Oh ... I see.... Please, I know he wants to talk to you....

00:03:24.260 --> 00:03:25.340
Thank you,

00:03:25.420 --> 00:03:28.140
and happy Thanksgiving to you and your family, too.

00:03:28.900 --> 00:03:31.960
Try to come by later for dessert.... Bye.

00:03:34.280 --> 00:03:35.740
That was Alexandra.

00:03:36.420 --> 00:03:37.500
She and the Molinas

00:03:37.500 --> 00:03:39.600
are going to spend Thanksgiving with their cousins.

00:03:40.080 --> 00:03:41.300
She doesn't have the phone number.

00:03:41.900 --> 00:03:43.440
Oh, Robbie will be disappointed.

00:03:44.440 --> 00:03:45.940
He'll be grouchy.

00:03:46.860 --> 00:03:48.880
Maybe she'll call back. She promised.

00:03:51.320 --> 00:03:52.740
Here's your cinnamon, Pop.

00:03:58.580 --> 00:04:01.120
It was a dollar and sixty cents.

00:04:04.540 --> 00:04:06.920
You forgot to ask me for the change.

00:04:08.520 --> 00:04:11.280
Or did you forget to give it to me?

00:04:17.880 --> 00:04:18.800
Thanks, Son.

00:04:21.560 --> 00:04:22.660
Alexandra called.

00:04:23.120 --> 00:04:24.140
I'll call her back.

00:04:24.320 --> 00:04:25.840
She said she'll call you later.

00:04:25.840 --> 00:04:26.680
She's not at home.

00:04:37.740 --> 00:04:39.560
You should have your breakfast, Son.

00:04:39.720 --> 00:04:40.540
Make you feel better.

00:04:41.220 --> 00:04:42.820
Protein, vitamins.

00:04:43.320 --> 00:04:44.820
She said she'll call back?

00:04:44.910 --> 00:04:45.880
Yes, she did.

00:04:47.220 --> 00:04:49.020
Good morning, everyone!

00:04:49.240 --> 00:04:50.340
Happy Turkey Day!

00:04:52.180 --> 00:04:53.240
What's wrong?

00:04:53.660 --> 00:04:55.900
Nothing. Absolutely nothing.

00:04:58.360 --> 00:05:00.040
What's gotten into him?

00:05:00.740 --> 00:05:02.320
He missed a phone call.

00:05:03.980 --> 00:05:05.220
Yes, Alexandra.

00:05:07.500 --> 00:05:12.320
It's nice to see young love.... Oh, to be young again!
